00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
Terrifier 3 is a horror, thriller film directed by Damien Leone.

3
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
Five years after surviving Art the Clown's Halloween massacre, Sienna and
Jonathan are still struggling to rebuild their shattered lives.

4
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
As the holiday season approaches, they try to embrace the Christmas
spirit and leave the horrors of the past behind.

5
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:06,000
But just when they think they're safe, Art returns, determined to
turn their holiday cheer into a new nightmare.

6
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:06,000
The festive season quickly unravels as Art unleashes his twisted
brand of terror, proving that no holiday is safe.

